{% extends "base.jinja2" %}

{% block content %}
<h1>Trav-SHACL</h1>
<p class="subtitle">A SHACL validator that plans the order of validation to find violations early.</p>
<p class="prose">Trav-SHACL validates a SHACL shape schema against an RDF graph that is accessible via a
SPARQL endpoint. It traverses the dependencies between the shapes and rewrites its queries based on the
entities that are already known to be invalid. This way, violations are reported early and unnecessary
work is avoided.</p>
<p class="prose">To start, provide the location of your shape schema and the URL of the SPARQL endpoint to check.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="{{ url_for('validation') }}">Validate a shape schema</a></p>
{% endblock %}
